<t id="1095" p="0.00 129.23" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Q: What is the product? Say what hazard you would warn a colleague about before running this. [5]</s></t>
<t id="1096" p="0.00 148.23" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Answer</s></t>
<t id="1097" p="0.00 279.47" LineHeight="auto"><s font="3" size="10.00" face="0">Hazard: benzene, carcinogen, carcinogenic, leukaemia, leukemia, haematotox, hematotox</s></t>
